F Here is a rewritten solution using C++:
```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    int luke, thomas, john;
    cout << "How many hot dogs did Luke eat? ";
    cin >> luke;
    thomas = 3 * luke;
    john = thomas / 2;
    cout << "John ate " << john << " hot dogs and Luke ate " << luke << " hot dogs. John ate " << john - luke << " more hot dogs than Luke." << endl;
    return 0;
}
```
Note that the I/O is rewritten to follow the C++ standard, and the program is now a simple program that calculates and prints out the solution. 
